Real finding fixed along the way: generalizing the inline route-building
code from concrete IO (Main.run's own context) to abstract F[_]: Async
(AppRoutes.all's generic signature) surfaced a NEW deprecation warning
on fileService[F] - fs2's Files[IO] resolves via a non-deprecated
Files.forIO/forLiftIO path for concrete IO, but abstract F[_]: Async
with no LiftIO evidence only resolves via the deprecated
Files.implicitForAsync fallback. Fixed with an explicit
`implicit val filesForF: Files[F] = Files.forAsync[F]` inside AppRoutes.all.

